# U32: the slots of allflame_exp_001. The idle frame (the slot chain with its collapsed swap,
# abyssal and hidden slots, the jewel sockets under the passive-tree dropdown's position);
# hover the Helmet slot (its tooltipFunc: the AddItemTooltip stand-in with the slot); open it
# and pick "None" (the selFunc: SetSelItemId, PopulateSlots, AddUndoState, buildFlag: a
# recalc through the bridge), then pick the helmet again; the Flask 1 activate checkbox off and
# on (changeFunc: active, the item set's active, AddUndoState, buildFlag); hover jewel socket
# #1 (DrawViewer with the socket viewer stand-in) and its dropdown; the wheel on Ring 1.
#! u32-expect ^7slot Helmet db nil
#! u32-expect ^7viewer 17
#! u32-expect undo: 4
fixture userdir=../../fixtures/user1
frames 2
load-build "Builds/allflame_exp_001.xml"
frames 2
key-down CTRL
press 3
key-up CTRL
frames 3
move 560 164
frames 2
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 560 184
frames 1
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 560 164
frames 1
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 560 200
frames 1
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 396 340
frames 2
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
